  <item>
    <title>S2E9. 两次诺贝尔奖，才搞明白这种致命疾病</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac7e8ec195d838e2aeeeed7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac7e8ec195d838e2aeeeed7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 19:05:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，一年一度的诺贝尔奖正在陆续揭晓。这期节目，我们就来聊聊历史上一个曾经两次登上诺奖舞台、也彻底改变了人类对“感染”和“神经退行性疾病”理解的故事——朊病毒病（prion disease）。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDfr0g9HQTqGI7C8z1PCe-CbjQ7.png"><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a></span></strong><span> 羊瘙痒病：故事从一群奇怪的羊开始</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a></span></strong><span> 克雅氏病的发现</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a></span></strong><span> 库鲁病：人与动物的故事汇合</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a></span></strong><span> 1976：第一次诺贝尔奖</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a></span></strong><span> 它既不是细菌，也不是病毒</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a></span></strong><span> 1997：Prion 与第二次诺贝尔奖</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a></span></strong><span> 疯牛病与食源性公共卫生危机</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a></span></strong><span> 今天仍然无药可治的绝症</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a></span></strong><span> 蛋白质的形状也能“复制”？从中心法则到神经退行性疾病</span></p><p><strong><span>参考资料：</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MzGc6UEtT/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MzGc6UEtT/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click"><span>我的朋友患上了朊病毒病，我们眼睁睁地看着她忘记了眼前人</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.cdc.gov/prions/about/index.html" data-url="https://www.cdc.gov/prions/about/index.html"><span>CDC - About Prion Disease</span></a></p><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><p><span>The Lady is a Tramp</span></p><p><strong><span>免责申明：</span></strong></p><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/624900e9f33bb86cde89b214/ltjrRALuJJy6uOH9wQ9qtXVKDZm-.m4a" length="21629294" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fih6zlbxG5xzX98ft4GQhxU9CQQ2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S2E8. 埃博拉：血疫与血殇</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a55c50f27a4eec16c405b71</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a55c50f27a4eec16c405b71</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 05:22:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 大家好呀～这一期节目给大家分享两本关于埃博拉的纪实文学《血疫》和《血殇》（其实是小羊和小林在选题的时候看成了不同的书😅）这两本书是出自同一作者理查德·普雷斯顿之手的姊妹篇。就让我们一起跟着作者的叙述，走进非洲的雨林和美国四级生物安全实验室，了解埃博拉病毒背后的故事。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgMb8b3slKMVfeEQZnE8rPsh2WX.png"><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 《血疫》和《血殇》故事简介</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> 埃博拉病毒知识速通</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a> 病毒来袭时，人与人的隔阂和沟通上的挑战</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> 救还是不救，胡玛尔·汗医生之死与伦理学困境</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1604">26:44</a> 科学家与护理战士：故事中的女性</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 推荐与结语</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>参考资料：</span></strong></p><p><span>《血疫》The Hot Zone [美]理查德·普雷斯顿</span></p><p><span>《血殇》Crisis in the Red Zone [美]理查德·普雷斯顿</span></p><p><a href="https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/ebola-disease" data-url="https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/ebola-disease"><span>WHO 埃博拉病</span></a></p><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><p><span>Zelimir Panic - Minuet in G major BWV Anh 116</span></p><p><strong><span>免责申明：</span></strong></p><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/624900e9f33bb86cde89b214/lpGWsDsSnDlO0WJYF9pZWiNz_gKT.m4a" length="39694929" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu9jA14a1_npD3F2To1r-e57s1UD.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S2E7. 汉坦病毒知识点速通</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a03f1751b7bd502950b7db5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a03f1751b7bd502950b7db5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 03:45:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 各位朋友们，好久没有和大家分享传染病相关的话题了。我们俩也试着追一次热点新闻，借着这次洪迪乌斯号邮轮事件，和大家分享一下汉坦病毒有关的知识~</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsvIbOcoTHqO-FZvW7X5GbLEQIGD.png"></figure><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 🚢洪迪乌斯号疫情简介</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a>🦠汉坦病毒简介</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>🐦可能的“零号病人”，人与自然的关系</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a>🏥汉坦病毒的流行病学和疫苗</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a>🌉《卡桑德拉大桥》：病菌、疫情与人性</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>参考资料：</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.who.int/emergencies/disease-outbreak-news/item/2026-DON600" data-url="https://www.who.int/emergencies/disease-outbreak-news/item/2026-DON600"><u><span>WHO 关于汉坦病毒疫情的官方新闻</span></u></a></p><p><a href="https://www.ithc.cn/jbym/view.action?bh=48&amp;type=2" data-url="https://www.ithc.cn/jbym/view.action?bh=48&amp;type=2"><span>汉坦病毒黄皮书</span></a></p><p><a href="https://health.cnr.cn/yg/20260507/t20260507_527612740.shtml" data-url="https://health.cnr.cn/yg/20260507/t20260507_527612740.shtml"><u><span>央广网：汉坦病毒介绍</span></u></a></p><p><a href="https://www.zgggws.com/cn/article/pdf/preview/10.11847/zgggws1146216.pdf" data-url="https://www.zgggws.com/cn/article/pdf/preview/10.11847/zgggws1146216.pdf"><u><span>汉坦病毒疫苗研究</span></u></a></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kzX8TsUP7t_L6fHZbUB7cg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kzX8TsUP7t_L6fHZbUB7cg"><span>安第斯病毒邮轮事件精细流行病学拼图与风险评估追踪</span></a></p><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1298917/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1298917/"><u><span>电影《卡桑德拉大桥》</span></u></a></p><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><p><span>《卡桑德拉大桥》插曲 </span><em><span>I'm still on my way</span></em></p><p><strong><span>免责申明：</span></strong></p><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
