    <itunes:duration>00:21:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnlUsZpf201G07ZjAW3aI2ZIJ5yl.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>S2E6. 《重症之后》：抢救成功了！然后呢？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d7a7e3b977fb2c47850b03</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d7a7e3b977fb2c47850b03</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Apr 2026 13:27:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目我们俩的口条都有进步（自认为），欢迎大家收听品鉴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天和大家分享的是丹妮拉·拉玛斯（Daniela Lamas）医生的著作《重症之后》。原著名：You Can Stop Humming Now: A Doctor's Stories of Life, Death, and in Between.</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsu_RnSf_T0g1oU7YJ03Rpk6D1tS.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> ✍️ 《重症之后》书籍 &amp; 作者简介</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 🫁 ECMO技术，与患者辛迪的故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 🧑‍⚕️ “叶医生”的传奇，以及柯P的心路历程：</span><em><span>人生的结局只有两种，一种有插管，一种没有插管</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">12:19</a> 🫀 人工心脏技术，与患者肖万、王十七的故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 🧠 脑损伤青年的康复之路</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> 👩 照护者的身心健康，也同样重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a> 💐 那些心智障碍者看到的世界</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>参考资料/提到的书和人物：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>《重症之后》[加] 丹妮拉·拉玛斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>《献给阿尔吉侬的花束》[美] 丹尼尔·凯斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>柯P的TED演讲：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tE411C7jd/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=4418b2ff067e413026106aeaac1a99a7" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tE411C7jd/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=4418b2ff067e413026106aeaac1a99a7"><span>正向的破坏</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>脱口秀演员王十七</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>Piano Tiro No.2 in E flat, Op.100 D.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55744">929:4</a>. Allegro moderato</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>免责声明：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
