  <item>
    <title>S2E5. 我们为什么要睡觉？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b522bef8b8079bfa46ebcf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b522bef8b8079bfa46ebcf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Mar 2026 09:03:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听众朋友们好久不见～ 春暖花开，春困秋乏，羊哈欠已经哈欠连天，大家周末有没有睡懒觉呢？🥱&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们想和大家分享的，是英国科学家马修·沃克的科普著作《我们为什么要睡觉？》。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtfgqzD7zKUkXruvvEJLT1WRgW0L.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>时间轴</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> ⏰ 先从生物钟开始说起</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 😴 我们是如何入睡的 &amp; 睡觉时发生了什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 👌 睡眠有什么好处？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">12:52</a> 🙅 睡不好有什么坏处？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 💭 聊聊做梦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 🥱 我们时代与社会的睡眠不足</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 📒 12条睡眠健康小贴士</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>背景音乐：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>Piano Tiro No.2 in E flat, Op.100 D.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55744">929:4</a>. Allegro moderato</span></p><span></span><h2><span>免责声明：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
