  <item>
    <title>S2E4. 电影《黑水》：PFAS 带来的环境健康危机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691aa708cbba038b42e45ac9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691aa708cbba038b42e45ac9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 04:44:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听众朋友们大家好呀～今天的这期《羊乘林》我们将通过一部电影《黑水》给大家介绍一下发生在美国的环境公害事件，以及和 PFAS 相关的公共卫生知识。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《黑水》是 2019 年上映的美国传记法律电影，由马克·法鲁洛、安妮·海瑟薇主演，根据律师罗伯特·比洛特（Robert Bilott）的真实故事改编。影片讲述了律师在调查一起牲畜死亡事件时，揭开了杜邦公司长期污染环境的真相，并与杜邦公司展开了几十年的法律斗争。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPdTTN_vfITN3GlSPcu3LlEQpIr.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">2:04</a> 电影《黑水》简介</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">8:12</a> 我们对《黑水》印象最深的情节</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 特氟龙、C8与PFAS</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> PFAS的健康危害</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a> 传统PFAS与新型PFAS</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 政府监管和流行病学研究的滞后性</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a> 其他环境公害事件：水俣病、痛痛病</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a> 尾声</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>参考资料</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://cen.acs.org/articles/94/i20/Perfluorinated-chemicals-taint-drinking-water.html?ref=search_results" data-url="https://cen.acs.org/articles/94/i20/Perfluorinated-chemicals-taint-drinking-water.html?ref=search_results"><span>Perfluorinated chemicals taint drinking water</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30331959/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30331959/"><span>美国电影《黑水》（Dark Waters）</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ehp.niehs.nih.gov/doi/10.1289/ehp.0800379#sec-3" data-url="https://ehp.niehs.nih.gov/doi/10.1289/ehp.0800379#sec-3"><span>NIEHS: C8 project</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.epa.gov/history/origins-epa" data-url="https://www.epa.gov/history/origins-epa"><span>EPA history</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0269749124018505?via%3Dihub#sec3" data-url="https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0269749124018505?via%3Dihub#sec3"><span>PFAS and microplastics</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.phsciencedata.cn/Share/wiki/wikiView?id=6f715481-bc63-4e85-acf2-2844e43d5859" data-url="https://www.phsciencedata.cn/Share/wiki/wikiView?id=6f715481-bc63-4e85-acf2-2844e43d5859"><span>水俣病</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>J.S. Bach: Minuet in G major, BWV Anh 116 (from Zelimir Panic)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>免责声明</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
