  <item>
    <title>Ep.16 模糊的记忆与迷失的时间：痴呆与认知功能障碍</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66de7e1bee04007d882bd7f6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66de7e1bee04007d882bd7f6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Sep 2024 04:48:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位听众朋友们好久不见，这一期节目和大家来聊一聊痴呆与认知功能障碍有关的话题</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiFd9wDEphKyxTWrEkmb7bqLySkS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">2:07</a> 痴呆的命名与病因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">3:40</a> 阿尔兹海默症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">5:22</a> 血管性痴呆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 路易小体痴呆与罗宾·威廉姆斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">8:34</a> 额颞叶痴呆与“医学黑历史”：额叶切除术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 痴呆 vs 正常老化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> 认知功能量表（MoCA）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> 提升痴呆风险的危险因素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 关注痴呆患者照护者的健康</span></p><span></span><p><span>【蒙特利尔认知评估 MoCA】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FroUMac_TIltbcAv4nIIeqViob4E.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/dementia" data-url="https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/dementia"><span>痴呆症（WHO）</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_9310689" data-url="https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_9310689"><span>罗宾·威廉姆斯 6 周年祭，谁夺走了他的生命？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://rs.yiigle.com/CN112137201815/1036198.htm" data-url="https://rs.yiigle.com/CN112137201815/1036198.htm"><span>2018 中国痴呆与认知障碍诊疗指南</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mocacognition.com/" data-url="https://mocacognition.com/"><span>蒙特利尔认知评估</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/983366.html" data-url="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/983366.html"><span>迷失钟表展</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.thelancet.com/article/S0140-6736(20)30367-6/fulltext#seccestitle400" data-url="https://www.thelancet.com/article/S0140-6736(20)30367-6/fulltext#seccestitle400"><span>Dementia prevention, intervention, and care: 2020 report of the Lancet Commission - The Lancet</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://wwwn.cdc.gov/tsp/phs/phs.aspx?phsid=1076&amp;toxid=34#:~:text=Oral%20exposure%20to%20aluminum%20is,found%20this%20to%20be%20true" data-url="https://wwwn.cdc.gov/tsp/phs/phs.aspx?phsid=1076&amp;toxid=34#:~:text=Oral%20exposure%20to%20aluminum%20is,found%20this%20to%20be%20true"><span>Aluminum | Public Health Statement</span></a><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/30356141" data-url="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/30356141"><span>额叶切除术，诺贝尔奖的“黑历史”？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>LEAVE（阿司匹林/Flamelking 福林先生）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【免责声明】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
