    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b70d101ed6d5797f46898d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jan 2024 02:27:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近热播的电视剧《繁花》把人们带回了上世纪八十年代的上海。当时的上海曾遭受过一场重大的甲肝疫情。今天借此机会与大家聊一聊病毒性肝炎。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQHim6kxM4Y4GxV2488ViCb0jIx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 《繁花》中的流行病：甲型病毒性肝炎</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> 毛蚶与上海甲肝大流行</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> “中国第一病”：乙型病毒性肝炎</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 乙肝疫苗：送给中国的礼物</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 丙型病毒性肝炎与特效药 DAA</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a> 丁肝与戊肝</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://finance.sina.cn/2020-02-10/detail-iimxyqvz1375443.d.html" data-url="https://finance.sina.cn/2020-02-10/detail-iimxyqvz1375443.d.html"><span>上海市原副市长回忆1988年上海甲肝大暴发</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FvbhTirn0TrjaNz1isSoag" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FvbhTirn0TrjaNz1isSoag"><span>丁香园 &nbsp;《繁花》男主得的这种病，曾影响 30 万上海人</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.zhishifenzi.com/depth/character/7013.html" data-url="http://www.zhishifenzi.com/depth/character/7013.html"><span>罗伊·瓦杰洛斯：给世界、中国和未来的礼物</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.xinhuanet.com/politics/2018-07/06/c_1123086176.htm" data-url="http://www.xinhuanet.com/politics/2018-07/06/c_1123086176.htm"><span>“我不是药神”情景再现：丙肝患者买国外仿制药续命</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Piano Trio No.2 in E flat, Op.100 D.929: 4. Allegro moderato (Beaux Arts Trio)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【免责声明】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
