  <item>
    <title>Ep.13 在随机喝咖啡的日子里，人们多走了1000步｜咖啡与流行病学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c6120ce8176c3ff8096d24</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c6120ce8176c3ff8096d24</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Jul 2023 07:32:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期节目我们一起来聊聊咖啡与流行病学。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6Z4I7rHsrYvt7makutaK9_WH5L.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a> 咖啡致癌性的争议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 咖啡与胰腺癌的病例对照研究</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="601">10:01</a> 咖啡与心血管疾病</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> 咖啡对心脏急性影响的随机对照试验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> 随机对照试验的外部真实性</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> 咖啡与抑郁症</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 咖啡与帕金森病</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> 咖啡预防帕金森病的争议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 我们应该如何喝咖啡</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【主要参考文献】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>综述：</span><a href="https://www.nejm.org/doi/10.1056/NEJMra1816604" data-url="https://www.nejm.org/doi/10.1056/NEJMra1816604"><span>咖啡，咖啡因与健康</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>RCT: </span><a href="https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa2204737" data-url="https://www.nejm.org/doi/full/10.1056/NEJMoa2204737"><span>咖啡和短期心脏影响</span></a><span> （“在随机喝咖啡的日子里，人们平均多走了1000步”出自这篇文章的研究结果）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.hsph.harvard.edu/nutritionsource/food-features/coffee/" data-url="https://www.hsph.harvard.edu/nutritionsource/food-features/coffee/"><span>哈佛大学公共卫生学院关于咖啡的介绍</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.p65warnings.ca.gov/fact-sheets/coffee-and-proposition-65-frequently-asked-questions" data-url="https://www.p65warnings.ca.gov/fact-sheets/coffee-and-proposition-65-frequently-asked-questions"><span>加州关于咖啡与致癌性标签的说明</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/7453739/" data-url="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/7453739/"><span>病例对照研究：咖啡与胰腺癌</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>J.S. Bach: Minuet in G major, BWV Anh 116 (from Zelimir Panic)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【免责声明】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
