  <item>
    <title>Ep.12 当我们谈论糖的时候，我们在谈论什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647d35131672628240e0bae1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647d35131672628240e0bae1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Jun 2023 01:06:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>营养学三大宏量营养素之一的糖类和我们每一个人的生活息息相关。随着社会的发展和生活水平的提高，人们开始关注饮食健康，控糖和戒糖也慢慢成为了一种流行趋势。当我们说“控糖”时，我们说的是什么？糖类在均衡膳食中扮演着怎么样的角色？代糖有害健康吗？本期节目我们将探讨这些和糖有关的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【原创封面图】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgrQAzhpNNmypEDoDusmzFfxgWiZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 什么是糖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 当我们说控糖的时候，控的是什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 如何控制添加糖的摄入</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 需要主食控制摄入吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> 生酮饮食</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 糖精的发现过程</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">21:35</a> 代糖的健康风险</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 代糖能帮助减肥吗</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="http://dg.cnsoc.org/article/04/J4-AsD_DR3OLQMnHG0-jZA.html" data-url="http://dg.cnsoc.org/article/04/J4-AsD_DR3OLQMnHG0-jZA.html"><span>《中国居民膳食指南（2022）》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《公卫食验室：解锁厨房里的健康密码》（出品单位：上海交通大学医学院公共卫生学院）</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.169.3949.962" data-url="https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/science.169.3949.962"><span>美国 FDA 禁用甜蜜素的报道</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.annalsofoncology.org/article/S0923-7534(19)51037-7/fulltext" data-url="https://www.annalsofoncology.org/article/S0923-7534(19)51037-7/fulltext"><span>代糖会致癌吗</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/should-you-try-the-keto-diet" data-url="https://www.health.harvard.edu/staying-healthy/should-you-try-the-keto-diet"><span>你应该尝试生酮饮食吗</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.who.int/news/item/15-05-2023-who-advises-not-to-use-non-sugar-sweeteners-for-weight-control-in-newly-released-guideline" data-url="https://www.who.int/news/item/15-05-2023-who-advises-not-to-use-non-sugar-sweeteners-for-weight-control-in-newly-released-guideline"><span>WHO 关于非糖甜味剂的最新推荐</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【拓展阅读】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://sspai.com/post/68857" data-url="https://sspai.com/post/68857"><span>甜味剂解密 1：果糖的甜蜜与烦恼</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://sspai.com/post/75350" data-url="https://sspai.com/post/75350"><span>甜味剂解密 2：关于代糖的几点迷思</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>J.S. Bach: Minuet in G major, BWV Anh 116 (from Zelimir Panic)</span></p><span></span><p><span>【免责声明】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目仅进行公共卫生常识及历史科普，所有知识性内容均来自于正规出版书籍、高等教育内容、官方公告文件、互联网百科等。本节目不涉及任何与疾病诊疗相关的建议。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltFGzvp-H_mLsxZmzU7oQ8nXKzcE.m4a" length="38870843" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0SGFiT2VXMm93blFKaEo3TmNFYURoaGcweG4ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
